# Standard BF callable native AArch64 with wide relative loop veneers
# Source bytes arrive as a presence marker and raw data byte
# Each instruction emits one tagged native byte template
# Opening loops test tape and enforce the callable execution budget
# Closing loops use an eight word wide relocation template
# Final zero marker and status complete the code record stream
